      'sys-2',
      'Why is a cache needed and what is its invalidation?',
      'A cache speeds up access and reduces load on the source. Invalidation is removing or refreshing stale data by TTL, change events, or explicit commands.',
    ),
    InterviewQuestion(
      'sys-3',
      'Which questions should you ask before designing a system?',
