    ),
    InterviewQuestion(
      'sys-5',
      'State the CAP theorem in plain words.',
      'Under network partitioning a distributed system chooses: availability (answer everyone) or consistency (single version of data). In practice you trade per data type: consistency for money, availability for feeds.',
    ),
    InterviewQuestion(
      'sys-6',
      'What are replication and read lag?',
